  "notes": [
    "The Codex `/goal` prompt that the Loop workspace's Extras tab copies now asks",
    "Codex to reissue `gator loop wait --max-seconds 3600` instead of 360 (Architect",
    "direction 2026-11-03). Every wait that ends without a turn costs Codex a model",
    "turn, and a wait still returns at once when it becomes Codex's turn, so a",
    "longer interval cuts idle turns to at most one an hour without slowing the",
    "loop. The protocol default stays 360; the Extras document, both copies of the",
    "Codex participant note, and the Dashboard charters say so.",
